Z||000005||dogtired||12-27-1999||06:24 AM||||With the names we use on the fourm, then looking at real names and addressess sometimes it takes me awhile to put 2+2 together  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I put your booklet and Code Key in the envelope lastnight and will get it in the mail today.<BR>Wanted to apologise here, I got busy today chasing a vacuum leak, & haven't found it yet??? But will try and look at those wires for the AC today.<BR>Guessing here, your connector got tangled up in the compressor and pulled it clear out of the bundle?  Even without looking, I am fairly sure it comes out of the bundle just above the compressor, this bundle goes all over the motor, that is probably why you are asking?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> With that location it may be necessary to look from underneath, before either of us find it?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif">   GOOD LUCK!||||reg||6
